ps/3816920/extras/876bad8ec9d358b0bcceee23ce422f54.avif?t=1754068648\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1754068648\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Atmospheric Exploration:\u00a0</strong>Wander through a forgotten place full of secrets.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1754068648\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Cozy Interactions:</strong> Cook questionable food, brew drinks, unlock doors, collect odd objects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1754068648\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Kept in the Dark:\u00a0</strong>Some things are hidden for a reason. You're not meant to see it all\u2014yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1754068648\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Strange Items &amp; Hidden Clues:\u00a0</strong>Perfect for players seeking slow-burn suspense and immersive storytelling over fast-paced action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1754068648\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Unusual Characters:\u00a0</strong>Meet others\u2026 if they let you. </p><p clas